Add DECSCUSR (CSI Ps SP q) cursor-shape escape support.

Hand-port of unmerged upstream PR mobile-shell/mosh#1355 (author dabeibao)
onto the mosh 1.4.0 release tag. The PR's raw diff does not apply cleanly
to 1.4.0 because master was reformatted by clang-format (PR #1292) after
the 1.4.0 tag; this patch reproduces the same DrawState cursor_shape field,
DECSCUSR parsing, and escape-emission logic against the pre-reformat code
style, plus the PR's e2e test (registered in src/tests/Makefile.am).

diff --git a/src/terminal/terminaldisplay.cc b/src/terminal/terminaldisplay.cc
index e7595c2..637f3c6 100644
--- a/src/terminal/terminaldisplay.cc
+++ b/src/terminal/terminaldisplay.cc
@@ -130,6 +130,12 @@ std::string Display::new_frame( bool initialized, const Framebuffer &last, const
     frame.append( tmp );
   }
 
+  /* has cursor shape changed? */
+  if ( f.ds.cursor_shape != frame.last_frame.ds.cursor_shape && f.ds.cursor_shape != -1 ) {
+    snprintf( tmp, 64, "\033[%d q", f.ds.cursor_shape );
+    frame.append( tmp );
+  }
+
   /* has size changed? */
   if ( (!initialized)
        || (f.ds.get_width() != frame.last_frame.ds.get_width())
